sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Mgr as Transport Manager (React Web App)
    participant API as ASP.NET Core Web API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant Push as Push Notification Service
    actor Pass as Passenger (Flutter App)

    Mgr->>API: GET /api/v1/approvals/pending
    API->>DB: Query RebookingProposals with State = PendingManagerApproval
    DB-->>API: Return Proposal Data, Passenger Impact & AI Tool Evidence
    API-->>Mgr: Display Manager Approval Workbench (Impact Metrics, Before/After)

    alt Manager Approves Proposal
        Mgr->>API: POST /api/v1/approvals/{id}/decision (Decision: Approve, ManagerSig)
        API->>DB: Begin DB Transaction
        API->>DB: ApplyApprovedOperationalChange (Cancel Old Service, Rebook Passengers)
        API->>DB: Insert ApprovalDecision Record (Signed & Timestamps)
        API->>DB: Commit Transaction
        API->>Push: Dispatch SendPassengerNotification (Push Alert)
        Push-->>Pass: Receive Push Alert: "Journey Rebooked on Bus NC-4589"
        API-->>Mgr: Proposal Status Updated to "Approved & Executed"
    else Manager Rejects Proposal
        Mgr->>API: POST /api/v1/approvals/{id}/decision (Decision: Reject, Reason: Cost High)
        API->>DB: Update Proposal Status = Rejected & Log Manager Reason
        API->>DB: Initiate Automatic Full Refund Processing
        API-->>Mgr: Proposal Status Updated to "Rejected - Refunds Triggered"
    end
